<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><title>BetterAuth demo</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css"></head><body><main class="mx-auto grid min-h-dvh max-w-5xl gap-10 px-5 py-[max(2rem,env(safe-area-inset-top))] sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] lg:items-center"><section><p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[.16em] text-violet">BETTERAUTH · LOCAL DEMO</p><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Register once. Keep control.</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-lg leading-8 opacity-75">A compact Symfony demonstration of application-owned authentication contracts. Inspect each JSON route, then replace the local adapters with your production services.</p><nav class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3" aria-label="Demo flows"><a class="min-h-11 rounded-md border px-4 py-3" href="#contracts">Contract map</a><a class="min-h-11 rounded-md bg-violet px-4 py-3 text-white" href="/api/me">Try me</a></nav></section><section id="contracts" class="rounded-xl border p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Create a local account</h2><form class="mt-5 grid gap-4" method="post" action="/api/register"><label>Email<input class="mt-1 block min-h-11 w-full rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Password<input class="mt-1 block min-h-11 w-full rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" required></label><button class="min-h-11 rounded-md bg-violet px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white">Register</button></form><p class="mt-4 text-sm opacity-70">Touch targets are at least 44px. Motion is state-only and disabled for reduced-motion users.</p></section></main></body></html>
